CodonTrace Genesis is research software for deterministic digital evolution,
causal mechanism auditing, replayable artificial life experiments,
capsule-mediated information transfer, skill-compression inheritance,
role/collective-behavior instrumentation, and evidence-gated scientific workflows.

Please cite the versioned release and DOI when using this software in research,
technical evaluation, prototypes, benchmarks, derivative work, or publications.

